# The Kotlin glue tauri/wry generate (src/main/java/**/generated) is committed on purpose: their
# build scripts write these files and watch them, so on a fresh CI checkout the first Rust pass
# created them and Gradle's second pass then rebuilt tauri, wry and the app (~2 min). Commit
# any changes they show after a Tauri update.
/src/main/jniLibs/**/*.so
/src/main/assets/tauri.conf.json
/tauri.build.gradle.kts
/proguard-tauri.pro
/tauri.properties